 'Radio':['Choose exactly one option from a small visible set.','Radio control, label and optional description.','Tab focuses the control; Space selects. Radios sharing a name allow one selection.'],
 'Dropdown Menu':['Choose an action or a view preference from a contextual menu.','Trigger, popup, grouped items, separator, optional icon.','Arrows and Home/End navigate; type a letter to focus a matching item; Escape closes and returns focus.'],
 'Tooltip':['Explain a control with short noninteractive supporting text.','Named trigger and description popup.','Hover or focus opens; Escape closes. Disabled controls use a focusable wrapper.'],
 'Banner':['Keep a status or instruction visible within the page.','Status icon, optional title, message, action and dismiss button.','Tab reaches actions and dismiss. The message remains until dismissed.'],
 'Empty State':['Explain missing data, an empty search or a failed request.','Optional icon, title, supporting copy and a specific action.','Tab reaches the action. Demo actions create, clear or retry local content.'],
 'Popover':['Place a short interactive panel beside its trigger.','Trigger, named anchored panel, content and optional actions.','Focus enters the panel; Escape and outside click close it. Interactive content remains usable.'],
 'Combobox':['Search and choose a single option from a long list.','Field, search input, listbox, option, clear button and status.','Type to filter; arrows move the active option; Enter commits; Escape closes; Tab moves on.'],
 'Loader':['Indicate work with an unknown duration.','Spinner and visible or accessible status label.','The loader is not focusable. Its containing region can expose aria-busy.'],
 'Skeleton':['Reserve space while known content loads.','Shapes matching text, avatar, card or table content. Fill follows a container with a defined height; CSS variables configure width, height, radius and avatar size. Reserve the final layout dimensions to avoid shifts.','Shapes are hidden from assistive technology; the region announces loading.'],
 'Pagination':['Navigate a bounded list of local data.','Previous/next, numbered pages, current page, count and optional page size.','Tab reaches available pages; disabled first/last controls cannot navigate.'],
 'Date Picker':['Choose a single local calendar date or a date range.','Field, calendar trigger, month controls, weekday/date grid and clear.','Arrows move by day/week; Home/End by week; PageUp/Down by month; Enter selects; Escape closes. Choose a start and end for range selection. Time entry is deferred.'],
 'Tag Input':['Enter and remove a small collection of text tags.','Field label, tags with named remove controls, text input and status.','Enter or comma adds; empty Backspace focuses the last removal control. Duplicates and limits produce feedback.'],
 'Command Palette':['Find and run a local command without navigating menus.','Named modal, search input, grouped results and shortcut guidance.','Ctrl/Cmd+K opens on pages with a palette; arrows navigate; Enter runs; Escape closes. Text editing is not intercepted.'],
 'Input':['Use a base input control in a custom layout.','Input control with optional icon, prefix or suffix. Labelled password and phone compositions are documented under Input Field.','Standard native text editing. Provide an accessible name.'],
 'Input Field':['Compose a labelled text, password or phone field.','Label, Input, optional description/error; password visibility toggle or phone prefix where needed.','Labels focus the control. Errors use aria-describedby. Password and phone helpers are optional. Phone formatting does not imply international-number validation.'],
 'Select':['Choose one known option without a search field.','Optional Input Field, trigger, styled option list, groups and disabled options.','Use arrows and typeahead; Enter commits. Searchable selection belongs to Combobox; multi-select is deferred.'],
 'Modal':['Focus attention on a short task requiring an explicit exit.','Native dialog, title, description, optional body and actions.','Focus is contained and restored. Escape closes. Backdrop dismissal can be disabled for explicit confirmations.'],
 'Table':['Read and operate on structured rows with stable identity.','Caption/context, header, rows/cells, optional selection and pagination.','Tab reaches sorting and checkbox controls; Space selects. Sorting changes data order without changing selected identities.'],
 'Toast':['Announce a transient result without blocking the current task.','Rune 16px icon, message, optional title/action and dismiss button.','Auto-dismiss at 3 seconds, except persistent/loading notifications. Expiry waits while focus is inside. Hover does not pause.'],
 'Tabs':['Switch between related panels within the current page.','Tablist, tabs and associated panels.','Left/Right and Home/End activate available tabs; disabled tabs are skipped.'],
 'Avatar':['Show identity and optional person selection.','Image or initials fallback, optional selected ring and group overflow.','Interactive avatars use buttons; selection exposes aria-pressed. Semantic success/error tones do not represent identity.'],
 'Input area':['Enter multiline text independently of messaging.','Textarea, optional Input Field, helper/error and character counter.','Enter inserts a newline; auto-resize respects a maximum height. Sending belongs to the Composer component.'],
 'Button group':['Connect related actions or pair a primary action with a menu.','Adjacent Buttons with shared seams; optional dropdown trigger.','Tab reaches each available action. Native buttons activate with Enter/Space.'],
 'Composer':['Compose a comment from a textarea and explicit actions.','Responsive card (320px minimum when space permits, 720px maximum), growing textarea, attachment Icon Button, context and model Select, microphone Icon Button and circular Send. Model and microphone interactions are local demos.','Enter inserts newline. Send is enabled for nonempty content, clears the text and announces a local confirmation. Attachment and context actions are local demonstrations.'],
 'Data workspace':['Exercise a complete local data flow.','Search, Table, Pagination, edit Modal, Empty State and Toast.','Keyboard users can filter, select, sort, navigate pages, edit and save. All data changes remain local.']
